msgctxt "76"
msgid "How's it going, Kiryu-san? You here for ramen, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Oh, you're... Ueda, right? The Acecook guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I thought your ramen got approved. Did something happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Nah, I just came to enjoy the atmosphere... oh, and of course that \"gotta "
"have it\" Kyushu No. 1 Star flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "You really are obsessed with ramen, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"You better believe it! After all, workin' at Acecook's practically my dream "
"job. Forget ramen for days⑬they got ramen for decades!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Oh, almost forgot. I brought along one of my ramen samples\r\n"
"and I really think you oughta have it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Kyushu No. 1 Star Ramen Sample<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "I mean, sure, I'll take it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I gotta say, this sample right here's the whole package! Ever wanted Kyushu "
"No. 1 Star on the road, or in between bites in the middle of a fight? Well "
"here ya go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"And with that... I'm headin' back to the office with my\r\n"
"heart satisfied and my belly full!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "How's it going, Kiryu-san? Are you here to eat ramen, too?"
msgstr ""

