msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"I swear... Making instant noodles that can compete with what I make in here?"
" That'll put me outta business!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Heh. You should be proud of him for putting a new touch on a classic recipe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"I gotta say, this sample right here's the whole package! Ever wanted Kyushu "
"No. 1 Star on the road, or in between bites in the middle of a fight? Well "
"here ya go!"
msgstr ""

